# Vilna service defaults, see systemd.preset(5).
# The first matching line in any preset file wins, so this file (50-)
# overrides the openSUSE and Aeon presets (90- and later).

# Network services that open ports: installed but off by default
# (decision of 2026-11-02, image/docs/composition.md, section 5).
# Users turn them on in Settings; Gloxi may do it only as an R3 action.
disable avahi-daemon.service
disable avahi-daemon.socket
disable smb.service
disable nmb.service
disable sshd.service
disable sshd.socket

# Vilna components (no effect until the units are installed)
enable herkos.service
enable gloxi.service
